 'orchard:seed-library':[{id:'propagator',name:'Amri Venn',role:'scientist',roleLabel:'Seed propagator',x:13,y:16,text:'Please leave the drawer labels in place. A seed without its history can be an expensive way to repeat somebody else’s mistake.',rumors:['We need wages this week and seed for next season. There is no answer that makes the calendar kinder.','The public shelf began with three stolen cuttings. That fact rarely makes it into our grant applications.']}],
 'lilt:tide-clinic':[{id:'triage-nurse',name:'Davi Oren',role:'medic',roleLabel:'Tide clinic nurse',x:13,y:16,text:'If you brought somebody who needs help, we will find space. If you came to ask who is paying for that space, take a number.',rumors:['The public-services desk by the landing coordinates medical passage between ports. The flight is part of the treatment.','Jorin waits with the ferry even after his shift ends. He says the tide does not keep office hours.']}],
 'ward:winter-annex':[{id:'ward-volunteer',name:'Jo Maren',role:'refugee',roleLabel:'Overflow ward volunteer',x:13,y:16,text:'I arrived here as a patient. My citizenship form is still in the queue, but somebody put my name on the staff rota. That helped.',rumors:['Sef at Bastion keeps a paper record when the registry refuses a person. Ink has become a form of shelter.','An empty bed still needs heat. That is the part the supply reports never understand.']}],
 'kiln:red-cloth-house':[{id:'watch-cook',name:'Beren Holt',role:'bartender',roleLabel:'Salvage-watch cook',x:15,y:16,text:'Everyone at this table has rescued someone. Nearly everyone has also done something they do not bring up over soup.',rumors:['Cinder can mean sanctuary or a protection bill. Ask which before you sign anything.','The nursery crews stopped talking while they worked. The new growth was listening.']}],
 'tallow:borrowed-clinic':[{id:'night-clinician',name:'Iven Tal',role:'medic',roleLabel:'Unregistered clinician',x:13,y:16,text:'Treatment first. Names afterward, if you want them written down. I have learned how dangerous a list can be.',rumors:['The public hospital is not the enemy. The permit office might be, depending on the morning.','Rusk’s couriers have brought us medicine and invoices. I have not decided which I resent more.']}],
 'newshore:ribs-market':[{id:'map-mender',name:'Ossa Pell',role:'courier',roleLabel:'Route-copy mender',x:14,y:16,text:'Keep the crossed-out places on the map. A route that used to be safe is often more dangerous than one nobody knows.',rumors:['Kindred has been taking arrivals the inner ports turn away. Somebody should take them filters instead of another speech.','The ship around us was meant to finish one journey. It has sheltered several generations since.']}],
 'chora:resonance-house':[{id:'interval-keeper',name:'Iri-between-Tides',role:'archivist',roleLabel:'Choral interval keeper',species:'choral',color:'#bdd8c7',x:14,y:16,text:'This room does not ask you to agree with us. It asks you to remain here long enough to learn what you are refusing.',rumors:['Vey speaks quickly for your benefit. We hope that does not make Vey lonely.','The silence between two voices belongs to both of them. A recording should remember that.']}],
 'tessera:backroom':[{id:'table-clerk',name:'Sena Marr',role:'broker',roleLabel:'House-account clerk',x:15,y:16,text:'The front tables settle arguments about money. The back tables decide who is allowed to have an argument.',rumors:['Rusk pays for the air plant. She is very good at reminding people what breathing costs.','A house rule is safest when it also applies to the house. Ours are still a work in progress.']}],
 'brassfall-works:union-room':[{id:'kitchen-steward',name:'Lia Sorn',role:'dockworker',roleLabel:'Strike-kitchen steward',x:14,y:16,text:'Workers, officers, managers: everybody eats. That does not mean everybody gets to write the settlement.',rumors:['The wage offer looks good until you compare it with the injury column.','A convoy has been delayed at customs. The filters in its hold matter more to me than the flag on its bow.']}],
 'kindred-landing:arrival-house':[{id:'arrival-guide',name:'Nell Varo',role:'settler',roleLabel:'Arrival-house volunteer',x:13,y:16,text:'You can rest before you decide where to go. A person can make a very bad promise when they are too tired to read it.',rumors:['There are paid care flights at the public-services desk. You will be carrying a person, not a cargo timer.','Some people rent a berth for a night and stay a year. We try to keep that from feeling like a failure.']}],
